{% doc %}
  Renders the self-hosted brand @font-face declarations.

  The brand faces are not in Shopify's font library, so they are self-hosted
  from `assets/` instead of coming from a `font_picker` setting:

  - Spectral        display serif, used for headings
  - Rethink Sans    variable grotesque (400-700), used for body copy and UI
  - HolidayFree     brush script, used for the My Story pull quote and signature

  Both subsets are declared per family. `latin-ext` carries the Latvian
  diacritics (ā č ē ģ ī ķ ļ ņ š ū ž) and must be present for the LV locale.

  HolidayFree is the exception on both counts. It is cut as one 10KB file
  covering 129 codepoints — basic Latin only, no Latvian diacritics — so it
  gets a single declaration held to the latin range. A Latvian character in
  the quote or signature falls through to the next family in the stack rather
  than rendering as tofu, which is the right trade for a decorative face.
  Note it carries no apostrophe of either kind, and no question mark.

  It also paints only two short runs of text well below the fold, so it is not
  preloaded from `layout/theme.liquid` the way the other two are —
  `font-display: swap` covers it.

  Rendered once from `layout/theme.liquid`, before any other styles.

  @example
  {% render 'fonts' %}
{% enddoc %}

{% style %}
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Spectral';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url({{ 'spectral-400-latin-ext.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
    unicode-range: U+0100-02BA, U+02BD-02C5, U+02C7-02CC, U+02CE-02D7, U+02DD-02FF, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+1D00-1DBF, U+1E00-1E9F, U+1EF2-1EFF, U+2020, U+20A0-20AB, U+20AD-20C0, U+2113, U+2C60-2C7F, U+A720-A7FF;
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Spectral';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url({{ 'spectral-400-latin.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
    unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+2000-206F, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Rethink Sans';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400 700;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url({{ 'rethink-sans-latin-ext.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
    unicode-range: U+0100-02BA, U+02BD-02C5, U+02C7-02CC, U+02CE-02D7, U+02DD-02FF, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+1D00-1DBF, U+1E00-1E9F, U+1EF2-1EFF, U+2020, U+20A0-20AB, U+20AD-20C0, U+2113, U+2C60-2C7F, U+A720-A7FF;
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Rethink Sans';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400 700;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url({{ 'rethink-sans-latin.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
    unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+2000-206F, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'HolidayFree';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url({{ 'HolidayFree.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
    unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+2000-206F, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;
  }
{% endstyle %}
